{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんこんばんは！\n新内眞衣です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/05/01/8990351/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"連休前の会社はバタバタです〜〜\nさらに年度初めだから変わった事が\nたくさん！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こないだ、私用で20時くらいに\n会社へ戻ったらまだまだ残業してる方が\nたくさんいて驚きました∑(ﾟДﾟ)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"社会人の皆さんいつもお疲れ様です。\n5月病に気をつけましょうね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/05/01/8990351/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/05/01/8990351/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生ドル"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"月曜日は生ドルに出させて頂きました！\n生ドルさん2周年！\n2期生も2周年！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ということで、2期生全員で\nお邪魔しました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生放送ということで、\n皆が緊張しているのが\n画面から溢れ出ていたと思いますが、\n温かく見守ってくれて\nありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてMCのかなさんもりんごさんも\nありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"実力をつけてからまたリベンジ\nしに行きます！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"透明なゾンビ越えるぞ！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/05/01/8990351/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと この日は\n生ドルのスタッフさんから\nケーキも頂きました！\n秒でなくなりました！さすが成長期！\n本当にありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/05/01/8990351/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ガールズアワード"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こないだの水曜日は\nGirlsAwardでした〜〜♩"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"命は美しい\n気づいたら片想い\nガールズルール"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"の3曲を披露したよ〜(*^_^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私自身、大学生の頃からよく行っていた\nイベントに出られるなんて\n夢のようでした〜〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/05/01/8990351/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初めてのGirlsAwardでの\nパフォーマンスだから凄く緊張したのに\n加え、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"命は美しいはまさかの玲奈さんポジ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やった事のない立ち位置だし\n振り付けも真逆だったので、\nもう緊張を通り越して\n顔とかガッチガチでした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/05/01/8990351/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも凄く楽しかったし\nいい経験になりました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"課題もたくさん見つけたから\n改善してこーっと♩"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また出られたらいいなあ〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"【お知らせ】"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/05/01/8990351/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"4/30 月刊エンタメさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂カフェのインタビューを\nしてきました〜〜！\nと、言いつつ色んな事を話してきました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/05/01/8990351/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/05/01/8990351/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"〜5/10 乃木坂カフェ\n遂に2週間切りました！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Last weekのスペシャルドリンクは\n今まで販売していた中から3つ決めます！\n皆さんがもう1度飲みたい！と\n思ったものを良かったら教えて下さい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ラスト10日盛り上げましょ〜o(^_-)O"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/05/01/8990351/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"5/3 のぎ天生放送"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またまた握手会にて\n生放送やっちゃいます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/05/01/8990351/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私が出る時間はまだわかりませんが\n握手が1〜3部なので後半組かな？？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お時間ある方は\n全部お見逃しなく( ´ ▽ ` )ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"詳しくはこちらから\nhttp://video.rakuten.co.jp/content/141526/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よろしくお願いします！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"遂にGW幕開けーー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日は全国握手会で\nみなみとペアです(*^_^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/05/01/8990351/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"マネージャー&アルバイトの\nカフェコンビに会いに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"是非15レーンへ\n遊びに来てくださいね〜〜o(^_-)O"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また書きます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/05/01/8990351/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/05/01/8990351/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"久しぶりに全身！"}],"source":"archive"}